or. \n\nLet me try guessing the file: it might be drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/intel_display_power.c? no. Let me grep the runtime pm file drivers/gpu/drm/i915/gt/intel_runtime... no.\n\nActually maybe i915_pm_runtime_suspend no longer exists in this kernel version and was renamed to intel_runtime_pm... Let me grep for \"i915_pm_runtime\" in a broad known file. Let me grep display/intel_display_power.c for \"i915_pm\".\n\nAlready: i915_pm -> nothing in display_power. Let me grep i915_driver.c for \"i915_pm\" to see all i915_pm_* usages and the .runtime/.power struct area."}}
