equired, I'll present the findings. But let me make a final broad attempt: grep \".suspend = i915_pm_runtime_suspend\" won't work cross-file. Let me try the remaining likely candidate files for the runtime pm: it's probably in the same file as intel_runtime_pm_init. Let me find that. Grep \"intel_runtime_pm_init\" broadly — try gem/i915_gem_pm.c (no), gt/intel_gt_pm.c? Let me grep that.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0hiy17qr","name":"rtk","arguments":{"pattern":"intel_runtime_pm_init","path":"drivers/gpu/drm/i915/gt/intel_gt_pm.c"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9g6z0xza","name":"rtk","arguments":{"pattern":"i915_pm_runtime_suspend","path":"drivers/gpu/drm/i915/gt/intel_gt_pm.c"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"ollama","model":"qwen3.8:27b-q8_0","usage":{"input":33049,"output":451,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":33500,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787788269839,"responseId":"chatcmpl-309","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0hiy17qr","toolName":"rtk","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Command failed: rtk grep intel_runtime_pm_init drivers/gpu/drm/i915/gt/intel_gt_pm.c"}],"details":{"exitCode":1},"isError":false,"timestamp":1787788290436},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9g6z0xza","toolName":"rtk","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Command failed: rtk grep i915_pm_runtime_suspend drivers/gpu/drm/i915/gt/intel_gt_pm.c"}],"details":{"exitCode":1},"isError":false,"timestamp":1787788290436},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me find where intel_runtime_pm_init_early is defined to locate the runtime file. Let me grep in a bunch. Actually, let me grep the i915 runtime file using a distinctive token. Let me grep \"i915_pm_runtime\" via the include dir display/intel_display_power.h (the .rpm = &i915_display_rpm_interface suggests rpm goes through a parent interface)